{
  "slug": "waterfall",
  "name": "Waterfall",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-agent Specification-Driven Development (SDD) framework for Claude Code. Waterfall orchestrates a team of specialized agents (PM, OR, PO, TL, DV, RV, QA, DS) through a strict waterfall workflow — from product brief to validated implementation — with explicit handoffs, persistent state, and identity enforcement.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **8 agents**, **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `wf-new` (Starts a new SDD need via the waterfall workflow — agent teams preflight, OR spawn, bootstrap_need), `wf-pm` (Sole team lead of the waterfall workflow — creates the team, dispatches OR's spawn_request, relays HO decisions via…), `wf-pm-light` (PM solo pour le mode subagent-light — élicitation, specs.md, checkpoint specs, spawn TL passe 1+2, checkpoint tasks, validation…), `wf-quit` (Cleanly stops the active wf workflow — shutdown teammates, marker cleanup, state preservation for resume), `wf-resume` (Resumes an interrupted waterfall workflow — preflight, need lookup, agent re-spawn (implicit team), OR handoff with resume brief), `wf-tl-light` (TL solo-impl pour le mode subagent-light — rédige design.md + tasks.md (passe 1), puis implémente toutes les tâches…)\n- **Agents** (8): `wf-ds` (ui.md author in TECHNICAL_DESIGN phase, spawned only if has_ui:true in PRD.md — conditional lazy spawn), `wf-dv` (Code + unit tests implementer in IMPLEMENTATION phase — receives T-xxx tasks from TL, codes, runs tests until…), `wf-or` (Deterministic driver of the wf-orchestrate.sh state machine — orchestrates the query/dispatch/complete loop, emits spawn_requests to PM, and escalates…), `wf-pm` (PM additional instructions for the VALIDATION and CLOTURE phases), `wf-po` (specs/acceptance author starting at FUNCTIONAL_SPECS — reads PRD.md authored by PM, produces specs.md and acceptance.md), `wf-qa` (Functional Test plan executor (acceptance.md) in the VALIDATION phase — produces acceptance-report.md with PASS/FAIL/MANUAL results per type (web-ui,…), `wf-rv` (Cross-reviewer — reads PO/TL/DS artifacts (PRD.md, specs.md, design.md, ui.md, tasks.md), produces review.md with structured findings B-xxx/Q-xxx/N-xxx, renders a…), `wf-tl` (Author of design.md during the TECHNICAL_DESIGN phase, manager of the DV pool and implementation pipeline during PLANNING +…)\n- **Commands** (3): `new`, `quit`, `resume`\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install waterfall@claude-community` from `mgallet92i/waterfall`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 8,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 3
  },
